{"unit_id":"wuzeno__dsh-library#card-zh","repo":"wuzeno/dsh-library","commit":"2fb727f3b0e5d2a0bc0dee358ad566bc0eeedb52","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH 资料库（dsh-library）是面向 Web 客户端的 DSH 插件，为每个工作区管理本机项目文件。它在侧栏提供资料库管理界面，并在对话输入区提供当前会话的资料范围控制；主要功能包括创建和关联资料库、批量导入文件与文件夹、按名称或来源路径查找文件，以及将授权原文件按需作为附件交给会话。用户可管理文件的排除、恢复和回收状态，也可选择会话是否使用资料库。适合希望按项目整理本机资料、并在聊天时选择性参考文件的 DSH 用户。使用前需要设置本机存储目录，并在存储设置中单独同意会话按需使用原文件。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:39-72","index.js:96-155","client.js:527-529","src/store.js:238-260"]}
{"unit_id":"wuzeno__dsh-library#card-en","repo":"wuzeno/dsh-library","commit":"2fb727f3b0e5d2a0bc0dee358ad566bc0eeedb52","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Library (dsh-library) organizes local project files by workspace. Its web panel creates libraries and imports files or folders. Per conversation, users select libraries, find files by name or source path, and attach originals when needed. Setup requires a local folder and consent for file use.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:39-72","index.js:96-155","client.js:527-529","src/store.js:238-260"]}
